{"ID":"20240506100123-1cbg8vd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100123-1cbg8vd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100123-1cbg8vd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627124009-7a9cm3q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612144913-mj5otpe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612144712-zj6wb7o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:49,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:49\u0026#125;","title":"248梅实（乌梅）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821181536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240709111517-2ju31ko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709111517-2ju31ko","updated":"20240709111517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山西、河南、河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈类环形或扁球形，直径1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm。表面乌黑色或棕黑色，皱缩不平，基部有圆形果梗痕。果核坚硬，椭圆形，棕黄色，表面有凹点；种子扁卵形，淡黄色。气微，味极酸。\n【性味】\t酸、涩，平。\n【功效】\t敛肺，涩肠，生津，安蛔。用于肺虚久咳，久痢滑肠，虚热消渴，蛔厥呕吐腹痛，胆道蛔虫症。\n【炙品】\t乌梅炭：本品形如乌梅，皮肉鼓起，表面焦黑色。味酸略有苦味。"}]},{"ID":"20240709111517-d2p6hj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709111517-d2p6hj3","updated":"20240709111517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103345-h4g8qmb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709111517-xeez55t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709111517-xeez55t","updated":"20240709111517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌梅"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDes